WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
The building receives electricity from the grid.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
Transformers adjust the voltage.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
Power reaches the rack, a cabinet that holds servers.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
Chips release heat when they work.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
Air or liquid picks up that heat inside the server.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
The facility carries that heat outside.
